<title>GERMANY: Moksel says lost 18.8 mln DM in 1996.</title>
<headline>Moksel says lost 18.8 mln DM in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHLOE, Germany 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German meat packer Moksel AG said on Friday it lost 18.8 million marks in 1996 as sales fell 11 percent to 457.8 million marks.</p>
<p>The company also said it expected improved results in 1997, while revenue was seen holding steady.</p>
</text>
